    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's nothing to \"figure out.\" the person who mattered, the one who actually had a purpose and a future... they aren't coming back. everything now is just an imitation of a life. it's like i'm just watching a movie of someone else's existence and i'm just waiting for the credits to roll.",
